  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, 속도를 빠르게 유지하고 전력을 다하지 마십시오. At Active, 열심히 하세요. At Well trained, 전력을 다해 노력하세요.",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above, 양손에 덤벨을 쥐거나 앵커가 앞쪽에 있도록 허리에 밴드를 감습니다. 밴드는 썰매처럼 여러분을 앞으로 끌어당겨야 합니다.",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning, 손으로 다시 밀어 올리세요. At higher levels, 햄스트링으로 몸을 뒤로 당기세요.",
